{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Pascal #19</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Fermat #15</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On each spin of the spinner shown, the arrow is equally likely to stop on any one of the four numbers. \n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Deanna spins the arrow on the spinner twice. She multiplies together the two numbers on which the arrow stops. Which product is most likely to occur?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7dfa4844c68c73c85697cb9dddd0a99ad73eb8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   2 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   4 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   6 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   8 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   12 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"393\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The possible products are (this can also be represented with a table):\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/b/51b515ecbe48968a9161a93dbf5b063619c3da6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\times 1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/4/d34a068fc593714a83c298e0e3570977270c1c89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\times 2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/c/5acc4bc2a3c4b5f107bca30c5a2a9b639697221d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\times 3 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d80064391d2bb4074d572a0eb1ceee782449ba42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\times 4 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97953b1d8db04d7782b7e60df41d23a0cb5e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aae69d5a3cf3e7239ddd216b41562e0c55d903f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/6/7665cc4223d31e60fba93de9e8e901b3bd737b3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 3 = 6$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d27141e139b95bfbd840f6102974a2545d6cbad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 4 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b4a9a68a4effe67f5ea0695524933ce7345cf39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 1 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/8/e28d1e652b6dc015f8ca44794e86577f322810a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 2 = 6$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/9/a59ba231a73dfff64aebe7625cb67a280c2b6d85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 3 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d07867fd832ae2363746a9cad97389af9878bce5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 4 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69285c6727e2935af0e074481c620dcf5345a891.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 1 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d037bd49957923de4c5fb6cac7257f72b4dc64a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0f8037d7acb21e0c73e5ae336584073ac16b8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 3 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541f4f0ac5c46d4e572ab6d69e704f8ad1810583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 4 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> appears <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> time, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> appears <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> appears <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> appears <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> appears <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> appears <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> appears <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> time, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> appears twice, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> appears once.\n</p><p>From these numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/b/58b9716711f5a99a7f36f40b4b700e899b354054.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" /> appears the most.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the possible pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69273482bff8727194f6407e55ac1bfa94d9c555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7a25c234892fb8a7738bc31e5ccee3bf9ad5afc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the possible pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a1acbf245a710398f64953985490d7b1134630b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/5/78561eb59286ee78766fdc37ef35399bf0355e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/0/5506b58320deb5004bf2ed2f1a5e3e672d6e326e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. There are more pairs than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has the highest number of pairs so far.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the possible pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/a/68a601c8e837eafe7d899c2ba96295b3637daf6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea44bd62795a5d84c16a028ff4fb079a5cb8e63f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> because all of the numbers are less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. There are less pairs than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has the highest number of pairs so far.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the possible pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/6/4c6f0e4cd615eb4d118bf243be6594935ad3de9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1924ac42c8e1d1cb79000224acbe2c46d4b22bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. There are less pairs than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the possible pairs are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/c/dcc1c720139325a2c3491ba41476d225311fcd1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/7347741cade420c9172f1251847efddfdeb489ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4, 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. There are less pairs than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/b/58b9716711f5a99a7f36f40b4b700e899b354054.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problem